 ### Hybrid Contour-and-Simplify
-Forms a fine iso-surface and immediately simplifies it slice-by-slice using MC and edge contractions. Sets it apart by enforcing "link conditions" to preserve topology while avoiding full fine-level storage. Choose when memory is constrained, though it is slower than grid-simplification-first methods. [Hybrid Contour-and-Simplify](14742-mesh-post-processing-and-simplification.md)
